Z||000004||BAM-BAM||04-19-2001||06:08 PM||||  Mike, the very tought that you are having doubt should tell you something. You currently have something that no one, at least as far as we know, has. That makes it a one of a kind. The intrinsic value to you and no one else, is the only factor you should consider. Can you picture your Silver Formula in a heap (not saying that would happen) because the guy you sold it to decided it needed to be driven. I know I couldn't. I see Fiero's for sell every day that are where I want mine to be. They are asking less for them than I will put into mine. But, it's the fact that "I" am going to build this one with my own two hands that drives my desire. Just a cool way of looking at things other than through the eyes of greed. You will enevidably make the right decision by you. What anyone else thinks or what they would do is really unimportant. BTW, I'm still looking for a cradle.<P>Peace, B2 OUT!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Knowledge is POWER!<BR>That is why the ignorant remain Weak!<p>[This message has been edited by BAM-BAM (edited 04-19-2001).]||||reg||6
