Z||000014||Cheever2||04-20-2001||01:21 PM||||If you told him you'll sell it to him, you shouldn't back out now.<P>On the other hand, I think in less than 50 years the only Fieros left will be the ones that we had the foresight NOW to preserve.  I believe somehow we need to set aside the most perfect examples of factory stock Fieros from each model year, and ideally in each color.  And some of the best customized Fieros too.  Sadly, I read here on the Forum that the Anaheim Museum is selling (or has sold) their cars.  Somebody needs to take on that responsibility, or we need to get corporate donations from somewhere and build a REAL museum.  <P>I'm starting to hear that Battle Hymn music again...<BR>||||reg||6
