Z||000016||mrfiero||04-22-2001||09:52 PM||||I appreciate everyones input into this matter.....even though a few of you are on a different wavelength than me.  I think it's sacrelegious to drive a low mileage Fiero, others think it's sacrelegious not to.......to each his own, I suppose.<P>After much thought I have come to the decision that this Formula is not doing me any good at this point in time as I don't have the funds available to own two Fieros that don't get driven.  I'll keep my 16K mile GT and will play with a Formula or '88 coupe as my daily driver.<P>So Ryan......it's all yours and I will give you a call or e-mail you.  I know you will take care of her and will appreciate it just like I do.  <P>Thanks again everyone.<P>BTW......I won't be buying the Trans-Am either (too much $$$).||||reg||1
